    <description>2021 CommSP FA KPI dashboard. NRT KPI capable reports. The targets are aligned to DCG-S CommSP&apos;s. To get the correct results, Sales Group must be set to &quot;contains DCG&quot;. Tracking linearity. Currently tracking Q421 (December)</description>
